            <div xml:id="d351">

                <pb facs="0464" n="376" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg376"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3437: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the American Delegation</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hull</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-16T12:00:00-03:00">December 16,
                        1933—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received December 16—11:25 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>60. Confidential for the President and Phillips. I find that resolution to end
                    Chaco war proposes that we agree to sanctions. I have taken steps designed to
                    keep the United States Government out of this obligation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
